      "data": {
        "text": "\"Create detect_image_labels.py in the current working directory.\nTask: detects labels or objects in a static image.\nUse one concrete external provider and make that provider identifiable in code.\n\"",
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bd94e2ab001SSrfQb0lp0ptJU",
